{
  "dom_id": "step-16739",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Raising a Rational Number to the Power of Zero",
  "problem": "What is the value of $\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)^0?$",
  "worked_solution": "Any number raised to the power of zero is equal to $1.$ So, \n\n$$\n\\left(\\dfrac{1}{2}\\right)^0=1.\n$$",
